ns against them. Users need to pay borrow rates for debt tokens, which are reflected in a borrow APY for each asset type (pool). This borrow rate is variable over time and determined through the utilization of the pool. The bounding curve is a family of different bonding curves adjusted automatically by LASA (Lending Automated Scaling Algorithm). For more information, see: [https://wisesoft.gitbook.io/wise/wise-lending-protocol/lasa-ai] In addition to normal deposit, withdraw, borrow, and payback functions, there are other interacting modes: - Solely deposit and withdraw allows the user to keep their funds private, enabling    them to withdraw even when the pools are borrowed empty. - Aave pools  allow for maximal capital efficiency by earning aave supply APY for not   borrowed funds. - Special curve pools nside beefy farms can be used as collateral, opening up new usage   possibilities for these asset types. - Users can pay back their borrow with lending shares of the same asset type, making it   easier to manage their positions. - Users save their collaterals and borrows inside a position NFT, making it possible   to trade their whole positions or use them in second-layer contracts   (e.g., spot trading with PTP NFT trading platforms).","kind":"dev","methods":{"borrowExactAmount(uint256,address,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to borrow ERC20 funds Requires user to have collateral."},"borrowExactAmountETH(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to borrow ETH funds Requires user to have collateral."},"borrowOnBehalfExactAmount(uint256,address,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to borrow ERC20 funds on behalf of _nftId owner, if approved."},"calculateBorrowShares(address,uint256,bool)":{"details":"Helper function to convert {_amount} of a certain pool with {_poolToken} into borrow shares. Includes devison by zero and share security checks. Needs latest pseudo amount for accurate result."},"calculateLendingShares(address,uint256,bool)":{"details":"Helper function to convert {_amount} of a certain pool with {_poolToken} into lending shares. Includes devison by zero and share security checks. Needs latest pseudo amount for accurate result."},"cashoutAmount(address,uint256)":{"details":"Helper function to convert {_shares} of a certain pool with {_poolToken} into lending token. Includes devison by zero and share security checks. Needs latest pseudo amount for accurate result."},"checkDeposit(uint256,address,address,uint256)":{"details":"External wrapper for {_checkDeposit}."},"checkPositionLocked(uint256,address)":{"details":"External wrapper for {_checkPositionLocked}."},"claimOwnership()":{"details":"Allows to claim master role. Must be called by proposer."},"collateralizeDeposit(uint256,address)":{"details":"Enables _poolToken to be used as a collateral."},"coreLiquidationIsolationPools(uint256,uint256,address,address,address,uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Wrapper function for liqudaiton flow"},"corePaybackFeeManager(address,uint256,uint256,uint256)":{"details":"External wrapper for {_corePayback} logic callable by feeMananger."},"depositExactAmount(uint256,address,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to supply _poolToken and user can decide if _poolToken should be collateralized."},"depositExactAmountETH(uint256)":{"details":"Allows to supply funds using ETH. Without converting to WETH, use ETH directly."},"depositExactAmountETHMint()":{"details":"Allows to supply funds using ETH. Without converting to WETH, use ETH directly, also mints position to avoid extra transaction."},"depositExactAmountMint(address,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to supply _poolToken and user can decide if _poolToken should be collateralized, also mints position to avoid extra transaction."},"isUncollateralized(uint256,address)":{"details":"Internal helper function calculating returning if a {_poolToken} of a {_nftId} is uncollateralized."},"liquidatePartiallyFromTokens(uint256,uint256,address,address,uint256)":{"details":"Function to liquidate a postion which reaches a debt ratio greater than 100%. The liquidator can choose token to payback and receive. (Both can differ!). The amount is in shares of the payback token. The liquidator gets an incentive which is calculated inside the liquidation logic."},"paybackAmount(address,uint256)":{"details":"Helper function to convert {_shares} of a certain pool with {_poolToken} into borrow token. Includes devison by zero and share security checks. Needs latest pseudo amount for accurate result."},"paybackExactAmount(uint256,address,uint256)":{"details":"Ability to payback ERC20 loans by providing exact payback amount."},"paybackExactAmountETH(uint256)":{"details":"Ability to payback ETH loans by providing exact payback amount."},"paybackExactShares(uint256,address,uint256)":{"details":"Ability to payback ERC20 loans by providing exact payback shares."},"proposeOwner(address)":{"details":"Allows to propose next master. Must be claimed by proposer."},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Removes master role. No ability to be in control."},"setRegistrationIsolationPool(uint256,bool)":{"details":"Registers position _nftId for isolation pool functionality"},"setVerifiedIsolationPool(address,bool)":{"details":"Allow to verify isolation pool."},"solelyDeposit(uint256,address,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to supply funds using ERC20 in solely mode, which does not earn APY, but keeps the funds private. Other users are restricted from borrowing these funds, owner can always withdraw even if all funds are borrowed."},"solelyDepositETH(uint256)":{"details":"Allows to supply funds using ETH in solely mode, which does not earn APY, but keeps the funds private. Other users are restricted from borrowing these funds, owner can always withdraw even if all funds are borrowed."},"solelyDepositETHMint()":{"details":"Allows to supply funds using ETH in solely mode, which does not earn APY, but keeps the funds private. Other users are restricted from borrowing these funds, owner can always withdraw even if all funds are borrowed. Also mints position to avoid extra transaction."},"solelyDepositMint(address,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to supply funds using ERC20 in solely mode, which does not earn APY, but keeps the funds private. Other users are restricted from borrowing these funds, owner can always withdraw even if all funds are borrowed. Also mints position to avoid extra transaction."},"solelyWithdraw(uint256,address,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to withdraw privately deposited ERC20 funds using input amount."},"solelyWithdrawETH(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to withdraw privately deposited ETH funds using input amount."},"syncManually(address)":{"details":"Allows to sync pool manually so that the pool is up to date."},"unCollateralizeDeposit(uint256,address)":{"details":"Disables _poolToken to be used as a collateral."},"withdrawExactAmount(uint256,address,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to withdraw publicly deposited ERC20 funds using exact amount."},"withdrawExactAmountETH(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to withdraw publicly deposited ETH funds using exact amount."},"withdrawExactShares(uint256,address,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to withdraw ERC20 funds using shares as input value"},"withdrawExactSharesETH(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to withdraw publicly deposited ETH funds using exact shares."},"withdrawOnBehalfExactAmount(uint256,address,uint256)":{"details":"Allows to withdraw privately deposited ERC20 on behalf of owner. Requires approval by _nftId owner."},"withdrawOnBehalfExactShares(uint256,address,uint256)":{"details":"Withdraws ERC20 funds on behalf of _nftId owner, requires approval."}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"contracts/WiseLending.sol":"WiseLending"},"evmVersion":"london","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":1},"remappings":[":@balancer-labs/=node_modules/@balancer-labs/",":@chainlink/=node_modules/@chainlink/",":@ensdomains/=nod